  m_text: "Some communities will need shelter during the disaster.\r\nIn lodging
    tasks, you\u2019ll decide where people should stay\u2014whether it\u2019s a shelter,
    motel, or other available site.\r\nYour goal is to place clients safely and quickly,
    based on capacity and urgency. We\u2019ll go into the details later.\r\n"
