  m_text: "When a community needs food, your agent will notify you and present a
    few possible options.\r\nEach option has its own pros and cons\u2014different
    costs, delivery times, and meal limits.\r\nYour job is to evaluate what matters
    most in the moment and choose the option that best fits the day\u2019s conditions.\r\nConfirm
    your decision, and your agent will handle the rest.\r\n"
