  m_text: "You\u2019ll work with several agents throughout the operation. I\u2019ll
    start with myself:  I'm Marcu, your <color=#8B0000><b>Regional Disaster Officer</b></color>.
    I'll keep you updated on the big picture - weather changes, community impact,
    and overall risk. If the situation shifts, I'll make sure you know immediately."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
