  m_text: "Most players start Day 1 by opening key facilities like shelters, kitchens,
    or casework sites.\r\nEach day, your needs may change based on demand and weather,
    so you\u2019ll adjust which facilities to open or expand.\r\nLater in the operation,
    you\u2019ll also be responsible for closing down facilities once they\u2019re
    no longer needed.\r\n"
