  m_text: "Each facility requires a certain number of staff before it can operate.
    You\u2019ll need to assign the right mix based on availability.\r\nIf you don\u2019t
    have enough people, you can train untrained workers or request additional help,
    which will arrive the next day.\r\nYour facilities only run when properly staffed,
    so visit the Workers panel often.\r\n"
