  m_text: "When a community needs shelter, you\u2019ll receive a lodging request.\r\nYou\u2019ll
    choose how many people to place, and where they should go\u2014such as a shelter
    or a motel. Each option has different costs, capacities, and impacts on satisfaction.\r\nJust
    review the options, check the impact panel on the left, and confirm the choice
    that makes the most sense for your situation.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb5f65f1ed54304f927d58539c83245, type: 2}
