  m_text: "Emergencies can happen at any time. For example, if flooding expands,
    an ERV delivering meals may get stuck on the road.\r\nWhen this happens, you\u2019ll
    see an emergency alert like this one. Review what went wrong, understand the
    impact, and decide how to respond.\r\nQuick reactions help prevent delays, protect
    resources, and keep clients safe.\r\n"
