  m_text: "All facility-related actions start here\u2014use the Facilities button
    in the bottom-left corner to open this panel.\r\nFrom this view, you can check
    what\u2019s already open, see what\u2019s under construction, and decide where
    to place new kitchens, shelters, or casework sites.\r\nWe briefly mentioned this
    during the map overview, but here is where you\u2019ll actually make every facility
    decision throughout the operation.\r\n"
