  m_text: Hi there, I'm Aisha I will assist you with managing <color=#8B0000><b>Workforces</b></color>.
    I'll help you assign workers, train untrained volunteers, and handle staffing
    shortfalls. If workers are unassigned or stretched too thin, I'll let you know
    right away.
